    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Callisto Shores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hiro Haruhara, high school senior on a class trip to the moon of Callisto. He and his classmates plan to spend a week of fun and relaxation in the resort town of Callisto Shores. Unfortunately, their dreams of an idyllic vacation are shattered when sudden calamity threatens not just their island vibes, but the world itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a mysterious researcher, Hiro is able to turn back the timeline to stop disaster before it can even begin - but in order to set things right he'll need to face down bullies, giant sea creatures, and time-fractured anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/f05ecf2878714dea567d6529a385fce6.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/f05ecf2878714dea567d6529a385fce6.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/f05ecf2878714dea567d6529a385fce6.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/ed5333a981e929991f05aff3b044e685.avif?t=1752092124\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysteries of Callisto Shores by altering the timeline of this fateful week alongside a cast of over 30 characters!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off your enemies in a real-time, baseball-themed combat engine featuring pitching, batting, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/158f976556b45055481c1cdf575b7eef.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/158f976556b45055481c1cdf575b7eef.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/158f976556b45055481c1cdf575b7eef.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat abilities by equipping baseball cards from the Galactic Baseball League - for example by adding Mars Mechanics players you can give your bat more oomph and create a pitching machine buddy or by adding players from the Ganymede Guardians you can harness the power of fire and ice in your pitches!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/967809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/967809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/967809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and side quests galore! You can take on shifts at the sushi restaurant, help the local fisherwoman get indiscriminate revenge on all sea life, or step in to the Holoblaster booth down at the pier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic soundtrack with character/location themes and fully scored cutscenes!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Callisto Shores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hiro Haruhara, high school senior on a class trip to the moon of Callisto. He and his classmates plan to spend a week of fun and relaxation in the resort town of Callisto Shores. Unfortunately, their dreams of an idyllic vacation are shattered when sudden calamity threatens not just their island vibes, but the world itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/36f9a01d886dc491133fd95180ae43ca.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a mysterious researcher, Hiro is able to turn back the timeline to stop disaster before it can even begin - but in order to set things right he'll need to face down bullies, giant sea creatures, and time-fractured anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/f05ecf2878714dea567d6529a385fce6.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/f05ecf2878714dea567d6529a385fce6.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras