7809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/967809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/967809a1fa27d197ca945440c1a052d7.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and side quests galore! You can take on shifts at the sushi restaurant, help the local fisherwoman get indiscriminate revenge on all sea life, or step in to the Holoblaster booth down at the pier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.poster.avif?t=1752092124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.webm?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714640/extras/844cc7fb070c0fd460bf3ef2ac94dfdc.mp4?t=1752092124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic soundtrack with character/location themes and fully scored cutscenes!</p></li></ul>",
